oke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"2493\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-34\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1223,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-66\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"306\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"984\" y=\"612\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"996\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3010\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"4067\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4789,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-66\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"306\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"984\" y=\"612\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Now, we need to find the side length of one container. </p>\n<p>Since the volume of a cube is </p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.677ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 3305.5 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\nV = s^3, \n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-56\" d=\"M52 648Q52 670 65 683H76Q118 680 181 680Q299 680 320 683H330Q336 677 336 674T334 656Q329 641 325 637H304Q282 635 274 635Q245 630 242 620Q242 618 271 36